schema: "0.4"
id: echo-of-manifestation-env-plane-of-echoes
type: image
quality: medium

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of the Plane of Echoes — Zone 7 of the Twilight Zone. This
    environment is a mirror-corruption of all previous zones simultaneously. The composition
    shows fractured reflections of every prior zone inverted and shattered into each other:
    fragments of the Faded Chapel's pews are embedded upside-down in the Sunken Market's
    shadow-water which flows upward along walls of the Bleached Asylum's corridor which
    opens into the Petrified Forest's canopy which grows through the Shattered Observatory's
    dome which contains the Resonance Core's gears. Everything is reversed — left becomes
    right, up becomes down, light sources cast shadow and shadows emit light. The geometry
    is impossible: staircases that connect to ceilings, doorways that open onto walls,
    corridors that curve back on themselves while remaining straight. Fractured reflections
    appear in every surface — not the viewer's reflection but reflections of things that
    should be behind the viewer, or that haven't happened yet. The color palette is all
    the previous zones' colors corrupted and inverted: amber becomes blue-white, indigo
    becomes sickly pale yellow, teal becomes burnt orange, white becomes void-black. The
    mood is the breakdown of coherent reality — a place that is every place and no place,
    where the laws of space have been transmuted into something hostile. Painterly style,
    deliberately disorienting composition.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, single coherent environment, symmetrical, normal perspective, colorful palette in normal register, low detail, flat shading, simple mirror effect"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1536
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "3:2"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    atmosphere: {weight: 3, description: "Mood matches prompt — dark, corrupted, liminal space feeling"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Depth and spatial structure readable, foreground-midground-background layers"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key architectural/environmental details from prompt present"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Dark fantasy painterly style, chiaroscuro lighting, indigo-amber palette"}
  reject_if:
    - "bright sunlight or cheerful atmosphere"
    - "modern or clean architecture"
    - "cartoon or anime style"

tags: [environment, zone-7, plane-of-echoes, mirror, inverted, concept-art, dark-fantasy, impossible-geometry]
